  "instructions": [
    "Heat 1 tablespoon of oil in a large Dutch oven over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the pork and cook until browned, about 5 minutes. Remove from heat and set aside.",
    "Add another tablespoon of oil and sauté the onion and garlic until softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the Japanese curry powder and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the velvety curry sauce, soy sauce, and coconut milk. Stir to combine.",
    "Return the pork to the pot and add the brown sugar and water. Bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce heat to low and braise for 1 1/2 hours, or until the pork is tender.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Serve hot over rice or noodles."
